	(title_block
		(title "VMT 04/16 controller - Fault Logic")
		(date "2026-11-03")
		(rev "0.1")
	)
	(lib_symbols)
	(text "Fault Logic\nHardwired fault logic - no firmware in this path. Rebuild of PL2 relays 2K2/2K3/2K4/2K6/2K7/2K8/2K9/2K18.\nRUN_CMD energises the run relay -> T_L+ (was Temp. button 2S1/2K2).\nEach fault relay holds itself through its field loop (xx_OUT -> PL1 contact -> xx_RET); armed by a pulse at run-on (2K3 + 2C1).\nExternal enable loop and all fault relays OK -> 2K4 -> TE_L+ (load mains on PL1). 2K4 NC -> FAULT_EXT.\nSTAT_* = 24 V copies of the relay states for Status_Inputs (read-only for the MCU)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 20.32 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ce315089-8c4a-40b5-a09c-ee6105759c98")
	)
	(text_box "TO DESIGN  (hardware only - no firmware in this path)\n- Run relay K_RUN (was 2S1/2K2): coil +24V, low side switched by N-MOSFET from RUN_CMD, 10k pull-down (MCU reset = off). NO contact: +24V -> T_L+.\n- 5 latching fault relays (2K6 F5 limiter, 2K7 fan M1 thermal, 2K8 specimen protection, 2K9 compressor thermal, 2K18 F2 overpressure):\n  T_L+ -> own NO hold contact -> xx_OUT -> field contact on PL1 -> xx_RET -> coil. Opens once = relay drops and stays off.\n- Arming (was 2K3 + 2C1/2R2): short pulse when T_L+ comes up, one K_ARM contact feeds every coil through its own diode (as 2V65..2V80).\n  Reset of a tripped fault = switch RUN off and on, same as the original.\n- Chain: T_L+ -> EXT_EN_OUT/RET (PL1 76/77) -> NO contacts of all 5 fault relays -> CHAIN_OUT/RET -> coil K_OK (was 2K4).\n- K_OK NO: T_L+ -> TE_L+ (coils 1K7/1K8 on PL1 = mains to all loads). K_OK NC: T_L+ -> FAULT_EXT (ext. relay 01/K2 + front FAULT LED, max 100 mA).\n- STAT_xx = coil voltage of each fault relay and K_OK (24 V = OK), to Status_Inputs.\n- Flyback diode on every coil. Resettable fuse in every line that leaves the board (xx_OUT, EXT_EN_OUT, CHAIN_OUT, TE_L+, FAULT_EXT).\n\nCOMPONENT PROPOSAL\n- Relays (8x: RUN, ARM, 5 faults, OK): Omron G5V-2-H1 DC24 (2 changeover, 24 V coil) - one type for the whole board. Alt: Panasonic TQ2-24V.\n- RUN driver: AO3400A + 10k pull-down. Flyback / arming diodes: 1N4148W.\n- Arming RC: start from original values (1k / capacitor) and tune for ~100 ms.\n- Fuses: PTC ~0.2 A hold, rated >= 30 V (e.g. Bourns MF-MSMF020, check rating) per outgoing line; TE_L+ sized after measuring 1K7+1K8 coil current (V6)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
